          "description": "Right triangle with a vertical left side, horizontal base and sloping hypotenuse. The right-angle marker is at the bottom left, alpha at the bottom right and beta at the top left.",
          "mathematics": "The side opposite alpha is 12, the side adjacent to alpha is 5 and the hypotenuse is 13. Relative to beta, the opposite side is 5 and the adjacent side is 12.",
          "answerVisibility": "Only the supplied side lengths, angle labels and right-angle marker are visible."
